And the third component is purpose. Can I live my life with a purpose? Do I feel like I am living my life with some kind of a passion or a purpose? And the purpose can be anything, right? It could be raising a family, it could be a career choice, it could be friends, it could be a hobby. So coherence, significance and purpose together comprise the sense of meaning we have in our lives. And we can see how in all cases religion can provide people meaning. So in the case of coherence, people's religious worldviews give them a coherent understanding of the world. And also religious traditions tell people, you matter, God loves you and you matter, or that this is all happening for a reason and

