00:44:49.000 --> 00:45:17.000
Does it have to be a religious community? Not necessarily. It could be any community that provides healthy and valuable connections to people. The second one, we talked about meaning and one of the interesting things that comes out of the scientific literature on comes out of the scientific literature of meaning is that the sources of meaning can vary widely for different people. So religion is a time-tested powerful source of meaning, no question about that, but it's not the only thing.

